00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:13,160
Dear Miss Wong, I am having some trouble with my classmates at the moment.

3
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:17,180
I’m getting along well with a boy in my class.

4
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:22,200
We often do homework together and we enjoy helping each other.

5
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:25,020
We have become really good friends.

6
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,980
But other students have started gossiping.

7
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:33,860
They say that this boy and I have fallen in love.

8
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,240
This has made me angry.

9
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,160
I don’t want to end the friendship,

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,200
but I hate others gossiping.

11
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,900
What should I do?
